            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.15 — A new New Tab</h3>
<ul>
<li>⌘T now opens a New Tab page: one box to open a site, search the web, jump to a tab, or ask Pane anything. Your most-visited sites sit underneath.</li>
<li>Asking turns the tab into a chat with Pane, right on the page, with follow-ups and a "Search the web" button under each answer. It runs on your Mac; nothing is sent anywhere.</li>
<li>Questions are spotted as you type, so Return asks; ⌘Return always does.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
